Software Development Environment:
Operating System: Windows 10/11 (Development OS, but portable to others).
Programming Language: Python 3.9+
Integrated Development Environment (IDE): Visual Studio Code.
Version Control System: Git.
Core Libraries and Frameworks:
Web Framework: Streamlit (version compatible with st.rerun(), e.g., 1.29.0 or higher).
Database: SQLite3 (built-in Python module).
AI API Client: groq Python client library.
Other Python Libraries: dotenv (for environment variables), hashlib (for password hashing), random (for shuffling), time (for timers).
AI Model and Service:
API Provider: Groq.
Large Language Model (LLM): llama3-8b-8192 (or similar, depending on availability and performance during development).
Hardware (Development Machine Example):
Processor: Intel Core i5 / AMD Ryzen 5 or equivalent.
RAM: 8 GB or more.
Storage: SSD recommended for faster performance.
Internet Connection: Required for API communication with Groq.
